# Dragon Noodles

Adapted from multiple sources including [https://www.budgetbytes.com/pork-peanut-dragon-noodle/…](https://www.budgetbytes.com/pork-peanut-dragon-noodles) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251201171051/https://www.budgetbytes.com/pork-peanut-dragon-noodles/)), [https://www.budgetbytes.com/spicy-noodle/…](https://www.budgetbytes.com/spicy-noodles) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251128105019/https://www.budgetbytes.com/spicy-noodles/)), and [https://food.amerikanki.com/stupid-easy-recipe-for-dragon-noodles-with-crispy-tofu-1-top-rate/…](https://food.amerikanki.com/stupid-easy-recipe-for-dragon-noodles-with-crispy-tofu-1-top-rated) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20240721075036/https://food.amerikanki.com/stupid-easy-recipe-for-dragon-noodles-with-crispy-tofu-1-top-rated/))

