:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 16 oz bag of [Lo Mein]{ ing="lo-mein" }, Wavy Egg, or Pad Thai/Rice Noodles
- [ ] some [vegetables]{ ing="vegetables" } (sliced pepper, zucchini, carrots, frozen stir fry mix, etc.)
- [ ] [green onions]{ ing="green-onions" }, sliced
- [ ] 1/3 cup [brown sugar]{ ing="brown-sugar" }
- [ ] 1/3 cup [soy sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" }
- [ ] 1/3 cup Sriracha or [Chili Garlic Sauce]{ ing="chili-garlic-sauce" }
- [ ] 1/2 lb [ground pork]{ ing="ground-pork" } or 16 oz extra-firm tofu
- [ ] 1/4 cup [unsalted peanuts]{ ing="unsalted-peanuts" } (for pork version)
- [ ] 3 [eggs]{ ing="egg" }
- [ ] fresh [cilantro]{ ing="cilantro" }

## Recipe

1. Boil water and cook the noodles according to the directions. Drain when done and set aside
1. Prep non-frozen [vegetables]{ ing="vegetables" } and set aside. Cut the [green onions]{ ing="green-onions" } into 1 inch pieces and set aside. In a small bowl, mix the [sauce]{ ing="chili-garlic-sauce" } of [brown sugar]{ ing="brown-sugar" }, [soy sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" }, and spicy sauce.
1. For the choice of protein:

   1. For tofu, cut into 1/2-inch cubes. Heat oil in a skillet until shimmering and cook the tofu in batches until golden brown. Turn once for about 3 min per side. Store the tofu on a plate.
   1. For the [pork]{ ing="ground-pork" }, brown in a skillet. Remove excess grease leaving at most 1 Tbsp.
1. For the frozen [vegetables]{ ing="vegetables" }, microwave them first, drain the water, and then add to the skillet. Brown with the non-frozen vegetables

   1. For the tofu, add a little bit of butter or oil to brown the [vegetables]{ ing="vegetables" }. And add the tofu last
   1. For the [pork]{ ing="ground-pork" }, don’t remove the pork before adding the [vegetables]{ ing="vegetables" } and add [peanuts]{ ing="unsalted-peanuts" }
1. Add the [sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" } and [green onions]{ ing="green-onions" } and simmer until reduced by half
1. Move the [vegetables]{ ing="vegetables" } to the sides (or remove them) and cook the [eggs]{ ing="egg" }
1. Toss with freshly chopped [cilantro]{ ing="cilantro" } and serve
